  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 替大家试过了，找工作最快的方法是筛选！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660b87ed2d9eae5d0a88016d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660b87ed2d9eae5d0a88016d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>HR不看简历怎么破？骑驴找马，这驴要是骑不动了呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>找工作怎么规避垃圾公司？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>今天咱们聊聊金三银四，普通人找工作的使用方法论，全程干货无水！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期采访嘉宾No.6 —— 佳佳（鄙人）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>4年运营人，零基础客服转行运营，堪称</span><strong><span>当代求职踩坑达人</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2年多期间，曾惨遭同公司5次裁员，从分公司逆势进阶总部（说不清是幸运还是不幸，都没被裁掉），现职场自媒体中~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> &nbsp;嘉宾介绍：客服转行运营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 就业环境这么差，offer到底是谁在接？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 找工作怎么筛选垃圾公司？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> &nbsp;我的奇葩面经：混合双打的群面也是惊了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 怎么判断一家公司，到底值不值得去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> &nbsp;找工作骑驴找马？那要是骑不动了呢......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> &nbsp;投简历，HR已读不会怎么破？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> &nbsp;怎么提高简历投递的精准度和邀约率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> &nbsp;社恐星人必看的面试方法论&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> &nbsp;找工作除了投简历，我们还能干嘛？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间原因，今天就先分享到这里啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有想要交流求职问题或者想交朋友的小伙伴，都可以扫码找到我。也欢迎大家在评论区留言互动，探讨你最近困扰的职场问题🙋‍♀️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmtWbsVkGcGgdTTuoz_PkyYSZKCN.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
